# The generated parser is COMMITTED, not ignored: every consumer of a
# tree-sitter grammar builds from `src/parser.c` and none of them run
# the CLI — nvim-treesitter fetches `files = { "src/parser.c" }`,
# Helix and Zed compile that path directly.  Ignoring it made this
# grammar unusable from every editor it was advertised for.
# `grammar_generated_test.rs` fails if it drifts from grammar.js.
/bindings/
/Cargo.toml
/binding.gyp
/node_modules/
